  <item>
    <title>Ep15.《习惯的力量》：开工没状态？惊人好习惯的万能实现机制</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a22640247d51713c980b4e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a22640247d51713c980b4e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Feb 2025 14:51:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025新春愉快！新年第一期邀请了公众号日更4年的荃姐，分享她的自律与习惯养成经验。荃姐通过日更公众号，不仅记录生活，还找到了一种自我疗愈的方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她还详细讲述了如何利用习惯的回路来坚持写作、坚持运动，并指出习惯的养成并非一蹴而就，而是需要长期的行动和反馈机制。不管是好习惯还是坏习惯，都是由提示、惯常行为和奖赏机制构成的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们还推荐了许多</span><strong><span>有助于好习惯养成的工具</span></strong><span>、探讨了</span><strong><span>培养意志力的方法</span></strong><span>，欢迎收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主播：芯芯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘉宾：那荃</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>麦下嘉宾：晓宇</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听指南】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 荃姐如何保持公众👸号日更4年？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> 习惯的形成回路：提示-惯常行为-奖赏。&amp; 坏习惯与其打断机制。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1357">22:37</a> 《习惯的力量》书评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1489">24:49</a> “关键习惯”及其作用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> 一套固定的流程更有助于习惯养成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2232">37:12</a> 好习惯的拦路虎：坏习惯及如何克服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2635">43:55</a> 好习惯养成的7个有效工具推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3089">51:29</a> 意志力也是个蓄水池</span></p>]]></description>
