  <item>
    <title>Ep14.复盘｜2024年8-11月读完的15本书</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67604b5784447b1bd0633604</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67604b5784447b1bd0633604</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Dec 2024 15:54:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我从去年开始会做每个月的阅读复盘，将该月读完的书都简单地进行总结。刚开始是每月一次，后来是2个月一次，今年下半年因为比较忙，所以频率更低了，上周才把8-11月这4个月的阅读情况合起来做了个总结。</span></p><span></span><p><span>4个月共读了15本书，共计171万字。其中小说和传记类共计8本、财经类共计2本、个人管理类3本、社会学1本、影响力构建1本。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下对每本书的读后感进行简要说明，也会附上我对每本书的喜好度打分，给大家做参考，仅代表个人喜好：</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【8-11月已读书籍】</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcQIw1L40MXpen_bCkVmwBKS2RE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h2><span>按喜好度排名：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《一间只属于自己的房间》 10/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《伤逝》 9/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《手机大脑》 9/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《平面国》 9/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《纳瓦尔宝典》 8/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《素食者》 8/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《刀锋》 8/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《人类群星闪耀时》 8/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《阅读是一座随身携带的避难所》 &nbsp;8/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《老后破产》 7/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《牧羊少年的奇幻之旅》 &nbsp;7/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《梁山无好汉》 7/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小米创业思考》 7/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《妈妈的银行账户》 &nbsp;7/10</span></p><span></span><p><span>《卡耐基魅力口才与说话技巧》 &nbsp;5/10</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ln4o7ET3YMaJQ939Gz8fGTWimWKG.m4a" length="44502502" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:23:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlpxVgkdKjGtg58_LDopO6kp5WwF.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep13.那些年吃得太好了！青春里的古早小说、作家、明星</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6755d290bdb9877a974b6434</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6755d290bdb9877a974b6434</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Dec 2024 18:31:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>为琼瑶阿姨的去世表示惋惜……其实我们这一代人对琼瑶的影视剧比较熟悉，看过琼瑶原著小说的不多。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的青春里，看得更多的是90年代-00年代的小说，郭敬明、韩寒、明晓溪、沧月、匪我思存、顾漫、桐华、饶雪漫、安妮宝贝……</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期我们录得很开心。感谢节目中提到的这些小说陪伴我们度过青春，虽然很多书在现在看来三观有待商榷，但我觉得没什么可批判的，套用一句最近很火的一部电影的台词：“让我们开心过的，就是好东西。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主播：芯芯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘉宾：小熊、xilla</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>麦下嘉宾：开朗</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听指南】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> 以前的网络小说江湖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a> 多个作家回顾、以及那些被翻拍的影视剧作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> 韩寒、郭敬明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1262">21:02</a> 沧月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a> 步非烟、张悦然、八月长安</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1534">25:34</a> 藤萍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> 明晓溪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2009">33:29</a> 流潋紫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2151">35:51</a> 唐七公子 vs 大风刮过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2395">39:55</a> 匪我思存</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2576">42:56</a> 顾漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2842">47:22</a> 辛夷坞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">48:50</a> 桐华</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3077">51:17</a> 饶雪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3184">53:04</a> 安妮宝贝（庆山）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3252">54:12</a> 因这些作品爆火的明星（马思纯、陈都灵、刘诗诗、吴倩、徐海乔、马可等）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3734">1:02:14</a> 最推荐看哪几本书</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><span>纠误：郭敬明通过新概念大赛一等奖进入文坛。2007年，王蒙是力荐郭敬明进作协。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhQF95bt5Bfu4SrjKbIWs2K6n79v.m4a" length="125824082" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmwRrEYOgKtV5t1qfEp4X-Bhv_bL.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep12.韩江与《素食者》：太有时代意义了，永远相信诺奖的含金量！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673442c8f373fe5d4deb7f29</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673442c8f373fe5d4deb7f29</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Nov 2024 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我为诺奖举大旗！本期节目邀请了我的好朋友小主，一起探讨诺贝尔文学奖获得者韩江及其作品《素食者》。韩江的作品，擅于采用多视角、梦境和诗意文字。</span></p><span></span><p><span>其代表作《素食者》，是许多人读韩江时的首选作品，它以平静却强烈的表达，揭示了女性在传统社会中自我意识的觉醒和压抑。韩江善于描绘个体故事，通过这些小人物的视角反映历史和社会问题，带给读者深刻的共鸣与思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>正如大家所说，她的作品社会性大于文学性，她的视角，总能带给我们新的碰撞，启发我们往更深处思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>主播：芯芯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘉宾：小主（宝藏女孩）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>麦下嘉宾：衣姐、国斌、Tony、明智</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【AI大纲】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">00:02:07</a> 韩江作品讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">00:05:29</a> 《素食者》讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">00:10:59</a> 个体的故事，宏大的历史：探索社会问题的视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">00:16:29</a> 寻求自我突破的男主与社会秩序的冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">00:22:00</a> 家庭关系与自我认同：英惠梦境背后的的心理隐性诉求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1651">00:27:31</a> 英惠的抉择：在压力与牺牲中寻找解脱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">00:33:03</a> 社会压力下的自我选择：弱者抗争与自我放弃之间的界限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2313">00:38:33</a> 追求自我与家庭平衡：挑战与思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2643">00:44:03</a> 英惠与姐姐：两个角色的内心挣扎与成长之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2968">00:49:28</a> 寻求选择的权利：女性角色在社会中的困境与反抗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3304">00:55:04</a> 寻找自我，逃离束缚：探讨自我价值与独立生活的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3634">01:00:34</a> 沟通与理解：父亲打孩子背后的隐含信息和沟通技巧的缺失</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【节目中提到的内容】</span></strong></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>书籍：《绝叫》《六个说谎的大学生》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>作家：柳翠虎</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>韩江书籍推荐：《少年来了》《不要告别》《白》《植物妻子》</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpZTMcq5e9SbVNJ-8hxdlPmBX6OE.m4a" length="64126710" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FseKdAQ_5zD6sfGvKWUsBHojOWv4.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep11.《平面国》：隐喻多到飞起，二维世界也荒诞！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671a60d159e38abc4687fc7e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671a60d159e38abc4687fc7e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Oct 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期探讨豆瓣9.2分、比肩《1984》的反乌托邦神作、写于十九世纪末的科幻小说《平面国：多维空间传奇往事》。这本书通过二维世界的设定，讽刺和隐喻了社会阶级、思想禁锢以及科学探索等现实问题，与我们生活中的许多现象产生共鸣。</span></p><span></span><p><span>而主角正方形与立体球的相遇，更是引发了我们关于整个社会的哲学思考……</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>主播：芯芯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘉宾：宽粉</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>麦下嘉宾：十四、晓宇</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【收听指南】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">00:01:11</a> &nbsp;《平面国》的背景介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">00:02:10</a> 书中的现实隐喻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">00:05:08</a> &nbsp;社会的规则与个人的自由：不规则图形的生存困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">00:10:14</a> &nbsp;探索真实的三维世界：平面国中的叛逆者之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="923">00:15:23</a> &nbsp;在大厂中追求完美规训的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1232">00:20:32</a> &nbsp;为女性权益而奋斗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1541">00:25:41</a> &nbsp;现代社会生存能力探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1848">00:30:48</a> &nbsp;《红楼梦》杂谈（约定下一个播客栏目）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2157">00:35:57</a> &nbsp;关于高架桥的哲学思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2462">00:41:02</a> &nbsp;平庸不是问题，关键是你如何看待平庸！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2774">00:46:14</a> &nbsp;那些历史上为国家、为真理牺牲自我的小个体们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3081">00:51:21</a> &nbsp;《平面国》：一本引发思考的小说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">00:53:00</a> &nbsp;读书方法探讨：如何阅读大部头书籍？</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【节目中提到的内容】</span></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>书籍：《秦制两千年》《大清为何轰然倒塌》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>播客：放学以后</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>探讨：向上而不是向北，然后呢？</span></strong></p>]]></description>
