  <item>
    <title>Ep10.《刀锋》：出走吧，然后得偿所愿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670bf0a8db2cf82757ee3392</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670bf0a8db2cf82757ee3392</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Oct 2024 16:09:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>毛姆的《刀锋》，讲述了一群各异的人，他们的选择和归宿各不相同。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们依然邀请了两位嘉宾，分享他们的阅读感受和思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么有人读完这本书会有辞职的冲动？书中的角色真的都得偿所愿了吗？这本书探讨了不同的人生选择，哪个才是真正的得救之道？这些问题都将在我们的讨论中揭晓，欢迎深入了解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>主播：芯芯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘉宾：康波、余</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【收听指南】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>本期讨论如下内容：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>书中重要男性：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>✓ 拉里</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>怎么理解拉里的淡然？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如果你是拉里，会选择同样的生活吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>100年过去了，大家对于“闲晃”的接受度有明显提升？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>怎么看待闲晃这种行为呢？对自己灵魂的救赎，其实不能算是没有意义</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>怎么看待拉里的非功利学习？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>✓ 艾略特</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>书中重要女性：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>✓ 伊莎贝尔、苏珊，甚至是索菲，都有自己的剧情线路。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>伊丽莎白，现实但知道自己要什么；和拉里的分手对谈，教科书式分手</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>苏珊，自由的人，最后为了女儿的未来，宁愿牺牲自由</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>索菲，从圆满到堕落的命运</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>关于毛姆这个作家，已经讨论了他的2部作品，大家怎么看他的作品？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【节目中提到的内容】</span></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>毛姆《人性的枷锁》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>黑塞《悉达多》</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvPq7dCl3F_o2z5-bWlPDMxsn20n.m4a" length="67497119" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:09:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv6BY9HC8Mr9gmPcZxVqDEcOZTht.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep09.《纳瓦尔宝典》：财富和幸福，我们全都要</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f81c3a81cdab3a93bbd9b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f81c3a81cdab3a93bbd9b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Sep 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>硅谷知名天使投资人纳瓦尔分享的人生智慧，包括如何不靠运气取得成功，利用专长和杠杆获得财富，以及他的幸福哲学。</span></p><span></span><p><span>书中的经典观点如坚定怀疑态度、独立思考、用头脑而非时间致富，引发了我们的深刻讨论。大家分享了自己的读书心得，以及如何在实际生活中运用这些智慧，书中满是操作性的建议，究竟它们是否能改变你的思维方式与人生轨迹？</span></p><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>主播：芯芯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘉宾：佩泽、青时</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>·</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【收听指南】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">00:01:58</a> 本书创作背景介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">00:02:55</a> 对本书的整体感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">00:07:37</a> 专长与判断力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">00:12:52</a> 独立思考在财富领域的运用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">00:15:01</a> 追风口 vs 深耕当前领域</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">00:17:08</a> 了解自己的决策方式，热情驱动 vs 自律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">00:18:30</a> 用头脑赚钱，而不是用时间。复利的价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1647">00:27:27</a> 不必害怕向上社交</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">00:29:15</a> 应该读什么书？怎么消化书中内容？（关于畅销书的讨论、费曼学习法、心智模型与决策）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2444">00:40:44</a> 甘蔗没有两头甜，判断力与倾向性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2574">00:42:54</a> 当下，还能选择一个有发展前景的行业、与有发展前景的人合作么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2937">00:48:57</a> 长期不变的事情，才值得投资</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3461">00:57:41</a> 给自己的时间设定价格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3828">01:03:48</a> 如何给休闲时间定价</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsMCcjqnFcVhhw0HxsKQq0VBCddx.m4a" length="72985873" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtprRwlDQJQDIkGfkjPI0zWAU6hi.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep08.《小米创业思考》：不油腻的‘霸道总裁’雷军</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66edab3c87a9242776b8dcda</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66edab3c87a9242776b8dcda</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期，我们讨论雷军的成长轨迹和创业激情、小米的互联网观念和效率提升、小米如何在高效中实现好与便宜的统一。</span></p><span></span><p><span>究竟雷军在小米模式中的有哪些独特思考？如何从这本书中获取启示？我们将带你一探究竟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>主播：芯芯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘉宾：国斌、苡萱</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【收听大纲】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:00:52</a> 大家都用过哪些小米系产品？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">00:03:02</a> 本书的总体介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">00:04:28</a> 雷军本人对做企业的追求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">00:06:20</a> 雷粉眼中的雷军</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">00:09:57</a> 雷军为什么看起来不油腻？自律、运动、保持学习心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">00:12:18</a> 小米的互联网思维</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">00:13:50</a> 小米模式的主轴是【效率】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">00:17:04</a> 小米团队的执行力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">00:18:42</a> 发现趋势、利用趋势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">00:21:18</a> 对爆款产品的追求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1437">00:23:57</a> 大公司常遇到的三个大坑：认知错位、惯性思维、偶像包袱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1566">00:26:06</a> 不喜欢“能把稻草卖出金条价格”的销售，这个时代更务实了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1683">00:28:03</a> 商业目的与远大愿景：成就成功公司的关键要素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1893">00:31:33</a> 小米的四个学习对象：同仁堂、海底捞、沃尔玛、无印良品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2034">00:33:54</a> 以质量取胜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2177">00:36:17</a> “米粉”是个什么样的群体？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2313">00:38:33</a> 雷军的务实形象与品牌影响力</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>注：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a>这段收音不好，但是内容比较干货，所以剪辑时还是保留了，大家不能接受的小伙伴可以跳过。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【节目中提到的内容】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>播客“皮蛋漫游记”：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>第15期-再谈小米（上）：我们心中真正的小米</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>第27期-再谈小米（下）：财报视角下真正的小米</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvGuog9lCzB8abrRF8T-FyasoDWO.m4a" length="41033025" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh6sBu56bKAWzC6mZoiG9Tjf3Axn.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep07.《老后破产》：拼命工作，依然过不好下半生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66df0418ee04007d88521a68</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66df0418ee04007d88521a68</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Sep 2024 14:20:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期，我们关注“养老”这一主题。《老后破产》这本书中采访的日本老人，尽管年轻时努力工作、存钱，老后却陷入孤独和经济拮据，甚至萌生轻生念头。长寿的背后，隐藏着许多未知的风险和挑战。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一现象引发担忧，东亚国家是否会步其后尘？</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望通过讨论这本书，探讨如何在年轻时未雨绸缪，帮助我们避免晚年陷入无助境地。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>主播：芯芯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘉宾：小灰灰（感谢带病参加！）</span></blockquote><span></span><h2><strong><span>【内容提要】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 本书内容简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 老后破产的案例分享：日本老人的生活困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 日本老人的今天，是中国老人的明天？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> 老人的追求：在无法预知的连环效应中努力生存</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> 菊齿女士的孤独</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> 现代社会的零社交需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 有尊严地死，和拮据地活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">22:27</a> 生育观念的转变：从养儿防老到独立个体的尊重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">26:56</a> 爱与治愈：用一生寻找童年记忆的勇敢之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1658">27:38</a> 女性贫困，无形中被剥削的女性们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1884">31:24</a> &nbsp;生娃、结婚与孤独感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2156">35:56</a> 养老，靠金钱，还是靠人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2355">39:15</a> 回农村养老现实吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> 如何避免破产？做好长期规划和财务计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2967">49:27</a> 打麻将、钓鱼，还是算术、扫雷？预防老年痴呆的多元方法</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【节目中提及内容】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>书籍：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《老后破产》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《无缘社会》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《女性贫困》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《东京贫困女子》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《人间喜剧》巴尔扎克</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《活着》余华</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《中国居民膳食指南》中国营养学会</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>两篇论文：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《农村老人自杀现象调查：在当地多被视作正常合理》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《农村老人谈自杀：喝农药上吊投河比亲儿子可靠》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>电影：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《入殓师》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpjGg-whEEFU8r4sauGZtGB8HMJl.m4a" length="53048975" type="audio/mp4"/>
