  <item>
    <title>Ep06.《我的外婆从不内耗》：爽文老太的前卫人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c8b3dc7ae3d6d8d2b3ef40</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c8b3dc7ae3d6d8d2b3ef40</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 24 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期邀请三位嘉宾，一同讨论畅销书《我的外婆，从不内耗》。这本书讲述了作者那位极具前卫思想的外婆，颠覆了传统老人形象，从嫁给家道中落的外公到70多岁独自赴加拿大生活半年，她的人生充满了独立和洒脱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>外婆教我们关注自我、精致生活，但书中却也充满了争议和矛盾，引发了关于女性主义与性别对立的热烈讨论。外婆的形象到底完美吗？她的生活选择是否矛盾？让我们一起细细品味这部作品。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主播：芯芯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘉宾：华仔、Kathy、书龙</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听指南】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> 作者&amp;本书梗概介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">03:48</a> 哄好自己：外婆的力量来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">9:15</a> 独立、自强与性别平等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 关于外婆形象的争议探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1111">18:31</a> 外婆嫁给外公的背后故事，令人好奇的下嫁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 外婆的形象：是艺术加工？真实存在？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1688">28:08</a> 外婆年轻时的家庭背景与中年经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1969">32:49</a> 中老年女性旅行团的隐秘需求：逃离压力与寻找自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2251">37:31</a> 探讨外婆的性格对孩子的潜在影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2506">41:46</a> 霸凌与自我拯救：软弱，吸引的是秃鹫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2784">46:24</a> 职场中，学会向领导表达不满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3063">51:03</a> 人际交往中，外婆的观点真的很实用！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lljKVL0X2R7g8OgWQldL0phvyIe5.m4a" length="54670481" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhseaIsLAMNgGCjO85tcdnNTKxnK.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep05.《金钱心理学》：如何理财更高效？｜理财主题阅读</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bf7491db5e6d6bf9d81176</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bf7491db5e6d6bf9d81176</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Aug 2024 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>理财不仅仅是投资，还包括财富分配和风险管理。</span></p><span></span><p><span>7月是我们的读书社群“理财”主题阅读月，除共读《金钱心理学》之外，大家还根据自己情况挑选其他理财相关书籍阅读。本次邀请群里的几位同学一起讨论，进行阅读复盘，希望也能启发你重新思考自己的理财方式。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主播：芯芯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘉宾：北冥有鱼、凯旋</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>麦下嘉宾：闻舒</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听指南】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 月光族：理财不只是存钱，更是投资自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 投资哲学的新境界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">07:38</a> 存钱是为了抵御风险，而不只是作为投资的本金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a> 风险与幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 投资成功的归因与背景：年龄、资源和偏好的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> 投资理财的乐观与悲观：如何正确看待市场预期？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">22:59</a>“豪车悖论”：别人不会像你那样去在意你的财产，中国环境下的财富观念审视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1841">30:41</a>投资理财需谨慎：房产杠杆背后的风险与人性弱点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2071">34:31</a>个人财务管理实战秘籍：小狗钱钱的理财实操方法分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2527">42:07</a>:精打细算生活：如何用记账有效管理自己的支出？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【书籍推荐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客中提及的理财相关书籍：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《金钱心理学》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《价值》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《文明、现代化、价值投资与中国》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《穷爸爸，富爸爸》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《小狗钱钱》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《大胆投资自己》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《巴菲特和索罗斯的投资哲学》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《老虎基金》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
